{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25810","headline":"杭州天竺灵隐二寺顷岁亦布衣一游及赴镇会稽不敢以登临自适竟不复到寺寺多猨猱谓之孙团弥长其类因追思爲诗二首 二 · 李绅","name":"杭州天竺灵隐二寺顷岁亦布衣一游及赴镇会稽不敢以登临自适竟不复到寺寺多猨猱谓之孙团弥长其类因追思爲诗二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人烟不隔江城近，水石虽清海气深。\n波动只观罗刹相，静居难识梵王心。\n鱼扃昼锁龙宫宝，雁塔高摩欲界金。\n近日尤闻重雕饰，世人遥礼二檀林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}